  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This makes 10 chapatis and takes about 40 minutes plus resting. Make a soft dough and rest it so the bread rolls thin and stays tender. Keep the pan hot so each chapati puffs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Roll each chapati evenly so it puffs into a round when it hits the hot pan."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "wholemeal-flour",
              "amount": 300,
              "unit": "g",
              "prepNote": null,
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "ghee",
              "amount": 2,
              "unit": "tbsp",
              "prepNote": null,
              "isOptional": true,
              "groupLabel": null
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Method"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Mix the flour with about 180ml warm water into a soft, smooth dough."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Knead for 5 minutes, then rest covered for 20 minutes."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Divide into 10 balls and roll each into a thin round."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Heat a frying pan until hot. Cook a chapati for 30 seconds until small bubbles form."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Flip and press the edges gently with a cloth so it puffs up. Cook the other side."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Brush with a little "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ghee",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                        "attrs": {
                          "termSlug": "ghee"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " if you like and keep warm in a cloth."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "troubleshooter",
        "attrs": {
          "items": [
            {
              "symptom": "The chapati did not puff",
              "cause": "The pan was not hot enough",
              "fix": "Heat the pan well and press the edges as it cooks."
            },
            {
              "symptom": "The bread is tough",
              "cause": "The dough was dry or unrested",
              "fix": "Use a softer dough and rest it before rolling."
            },
            {
              "symptom": "The chapati is thick",
              "cause": "It was not rolled thin",
              "fix": "Roll each one thinner and more evenly."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Where this dish lives"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chapati is the daily bread of much of India. It is plain, soft and quick to make. People use it to scoop up dal and curry. A stack wrapped in a cloth stays warm at the table. Making it well takes a little practice."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
